PART-2 VERDICT:
  (A) linear-K enhancement: SYMMETRY-FORBIDDEN (K is T-odd) -> stays (H/M)^2.
  (B) c_chi is a free coupling, self-renormalizing, NOT H-locked by running.
  (C) no symmetry pins c_chi (spin-0 != spin-2; c_T fixes beta, not c_chi);
      and a symmetry lock would give const, not f(H) -- would not close the gap.
  (D) GH-thermal shift ~ (T_dS/M)^2 = (H/M)^2: same dead suppression.
  (E) decisive: lock needs M~H; EFT floor forces M>=meV, ~30+ decades above H.
  => ROUTE 1 (dS-radiative/curvature) does NOT force c_chi=f(H).
     c_chi remains a FREE PPN coupling that must be TUNED to land the
